                            Set the log pattern.␀print_context_only␀Report all output as json␀changeps1␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀When using activate, change the command prompt ($PS1) to include the activated environment.␀shell_completion␀␀␀␀Enable or disable shell autocompletion (currently works for bash and zsh).␀env_prompt␀␀␀Template for prompt modification based on the active environment.␀␀␀␀␀␀␀
                        Currently supported template variables are '{prefix}', '{name}', and '{default_env}'.
                        '{prefix}' is the absolute path to the active environment. '{name}' is the basename
                        of the active environment prefix. '{default_env}' holds the value of '{name}' if the
                        active environment is a named environment ('-n' flag), or otherwise holds the value
